Error [E0335]: a call takes only one trailing block
  --> tests/ui/trailing_block_double.jet:7:26
    |
  7 |     twice { print("a") } { print("b") }
    |                          ^
 Why: a trailing `{ }` fills exactly one last argument; a second `{ }` has nothing to fill
 Fix: pass the extra block as an ordinary argument inside the parentheses, or remove it
